window.products.push({"id":464077,"name":"Olive Oil sprayer Mister for Cooking- Stainless Steel Glass Spray Oil Bottle Dispenser for Kitchen Air Fryer BBQ Salad Baking Roasting Grilling - 1 Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F+NRVPuXL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"𝗧𝗜𝗣𝗦 -TO Get better spray ffect, we recommend to pour water into the bottle to spray before using the sprayer. Due to the high viscosity of the oil, the dry environment inside the sprayer will affect the spray effect. First perform a spray test with water to make the inside of the sprayer wet enough, and then use the oil, the spray effect will be better. 𝗠𝘂𝗹𝘁𝗶 𝗣𝘂𝗿𝗽𝗼𝘀𝗲 - Come with 1x Mini Funnel, 1x Cleaning Brush,1x Oil brush and 1x Silicon Cover. This oil sprayer can be used for filling olive oil, vinegar, vegetable oil,lemon and lime juice, sauce, sherry or wine etc. Perfect for cooking, making salad, grilling, baking, roasting and frying barbecue etc. Do not put density oil in the dispenser. 𝗙𝘂𝗹𝗹𝘆 𝗪𝗿𝗮𝗽𝗽𝗲𝗱 𝗦𝗶𝗹𝗶𝗰𝗼𝗻𝗲 𝗖𝗼𝘃𝗲𝗿 - Compared with most other oil dispenser equipped with bottom cover in the market, our ultra thick & durable all around silicone cover provide the most protection & firm grip surface for your slippery oil spray bottle. Non- Slip and not easy to broken. Shield your oil mister from everyday wear, breakages, dents, and more. 𝗟𝗲𝘀𝘀 𝗢𝗶𝗹 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗬𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗙𝗼𝗼𝗱 - Healthy life start from controlling oil. If you need a kitchen tool to help you control the oil, to keep fit, try our sprayer, mist oil instead of pouring, less calorie. High efficient use, without wasting. Improve the taste, more Healthy. 𝗘𝗮𝘀𝘆 𝘁𝗼 𝗨𝘀𝗲 - The oil sprayer dispenser is of 100ml capacity,simply click upon the pressure pump to spray a fine mist. As the density of the oil is different from the water, the oil' s performance may not so good as the water when it is sprayed, we suggest you can put the sprayer more higher a little when you use olive oil, keep the bottle staying vertical as possible to get better shaped mist. Please don’t tilt the bottle less than 45º..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F+NRVPuXL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIFUSI","source_asin":"B089VYDXFR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-464077","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089VYDXFR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089VYDXFR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
