window.products.push({"id":464304,"name":"POWEART Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 26Kpa 8-in-1 Lightweight Cordless Stick Vacuum, 350W Rechargeable Battery Vacuum Up to 45min Runtime, Self-Standing C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YPBxeJIDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Robust Suction & Comprehensive Cleaning】Cordless vacuum cleaner boasts a powerful 350W brushless motor that provides a suction of up to 26KPa while maintaining a relatively quiet environment. The dual-mode design of the cordless stick vacuum performs excellently on all types of hard floors, such as tiles, marble, and hardwood floors. The high-speed mode is particularly suitable for cleaning short-haired carpets, pet hair, grains, cat litter, and dust, among other large particle debris. This vacuum cleaner can make your home environment cleaner, bringing you and your family a healthier life. 【8-in-1 Multi-purpose Cleaning】Enjoy the convenience of a versatile cleaning experience with our 8-in-1 battery cordless vacuum. With a retractable tube, flexible hose, and three useful attachments, including the main floor brush head, 2-in-1 brush, and crevice tool, this lightweight stick vacuum cleaner can tackle any cleaning task. Whether you need to clean hard floors or low-pile carpets, our rechargeable cordless stick vacuum cleaner can easily transition between surfaces with its extended tube and flexible main brush. 【5-Stage High-efficiency Filtration System】This lightweight cordless vacuum cleaner is equipped with an advanced 5-stage filtration system that efficiently captures and traps even the tiniest dust particles measuring 0.1 microns, ensuring a filtration rate of 99.99%. The washable strainer and reusable HEPA filter work in perfect harmony to filter dust and dirt, providing optimal performance while also safeguarding the motor. Compared to traditional cotton filters, the high-density HEPA filter is 200% more effective and boasts a longer lifespan. 【45mins Long-lasting Runtime】This rechargeable cordless vacuum cleaner is powered by a state-of-the-art 8-cell lithium battery that boasts a large capacity of 2200mAh. In Standard mode, the vacuum can run for up to 45 minutes, while in High-speed mode, it can last for 20 minutes. It takes only about 4.5 hours to fully charge the battery, and you have two options for charging it: either while it's attached to the vacuum or separately. Additionally, you can purchase a spare battery pack to save even more time and increase convenience. 【Flexible LED Motorized Floor Head】This powerful cordless vacuum cleaner with a battery-powered motor has a floor head that is both flexible and motorized, boasting 8 LED lights. The roller brush consists of both soft and stiff bristles, which allow for efficient cleaning of dust and debris without causing any floor scratches or tangling. The LED lights are especially useful in dim or hard-to-reach areas, providing better visibility while cleaning. Additionally, the floor head can rotate vertically up to 90° and horizontally up to 150°, enabling it to effortlessly reach tight spaces and clean underneath furniture. 【Convenient Design and Self-standing Storage】A rechargeable stick cordless vacuum cleaner that stands on its own can save you both time and effort. Its 1L dustbin can hold a significant amount of debris and be easily emptied with the push of a button. This lightweight stick vacuum includes a wall-mounted storage rack and cleaning tools. There are even more surprises waiting for you to discover! The POWEART V870 wireless quiet vacuum can be your perfect cleaning partner. 【100% Satisfactory After-Sales】 Our POWEART vacuum cordless comes with 24/7 customer service and a 12-month warranty for accessories replacement. If you have any questions about our hard floor vacuum, feel free to contact us and we'll respond as soon as possible. Plus, it makes a great gift for friends and family! Revolutionize the way you clean your home with the POWEART vacuum cleaner!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YPBxeJIDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POWEART","source_asin":"B0C5H1W687","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-464304","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5H1W687","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5H1W687","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
