window.products.push({"id":464406,"name":"Hurom H310A Personal Self Feeding Slow Masticating Juicer (HP Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":379.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+nlkkifmL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Stylish Design: Our HP slow juicer has subtle, sweeping curves that will catch will everyone’s eye. While it holds less juice than our other juicers, the HP is an ideal for the solution for personal or even family use. Slow Squeeze Technology: The HP rotates at a speed of just 43 revolutions per minute to mimic the motion of hand squeezing juice. This patented Slow Squeeze Technology ensures your juice stays fresh and in its most natural state. Taste: We’ve spent decades perfecting our slow juicers for taste. Our juice is fresh, unprocessed and pure. Yield: Our unique low-speed auger squeezes every drop of juice, resulting in bone-dry pulp. Easy to Clean: During juicing, the inner spinning brush rotates to clean the chamber and strainer simultaneously, reducing clogging and increasing juicing efficiency. The HP can also be quickly disassembled and assembled, making cleaning a breeze.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+nlkkifmL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hurom","source_asin":"B07KCN7GX8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-464406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KCN7GX8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KCN7GX8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
