window.products.push({"id":464445,"name":"Houwsbaby Small Burlap Christmas Tree Skirt with Knitted Plaid Border 3D Snowman Home Decoration Mat Double Layers Xmas Ornament Holiday Accessories T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A11prSmUjML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Burlap ADORABLE APPEARANCE---Our tree skirt has a red burlap center with Santa Claus, Xmas tree and snowflake patterns. This 3D snowman is playing in the snow, he wears a stylish and exquisite clothes and matches with the similar hat, the green scarf looks fashion and warm. The knitted turtan border add more special flavor. Use it to cover the shelf of bottom of the tree and make your tree have a more good view. EASY TO INSTALL---The cozy tree skirt easily wraps around an artificial or real Christmas tree skirt with the help of two ties embroidered at the opening. They make it easy to fix and lock, allow you to secure tree skirt around and in place underneath the Christmas tree, and then you can put the ornaments you like on the tree skirt for more Christmas atmosphere. Meanwhile, two tied up bow-ties make it more attractive among other Christmas decorations. PERFECT SIZE AND EASY STORAGE : Outer diameter of our tree skirt is 32 inches. Size of 32 inches can let you put enough things on our Christmas tree skirt. Inner diameter of this tree skirt is 3 inches. Most Christmas trees can get through the hole. So you don’t need to worry that your Christmas tree will be stuck. With the soft cloth strings at the opening, you can remove our tree skirt from Xmas tree at ease. And with the opening, you can fold this tree skirt neatly to store. ELEGANT SMOOTHING WARMTH---Our Christmas tree skirt has a thick flax cloth embroidered festive patterns with plaid knitted border. Our Christmas tree skirt provide the high quality in the lower price with value. Handmade by craftsmen, mercerized velvet makes it more soft. It is extremely well made with double layer design. Durable and lightweight, this Christmas tree skirt is washable and reusable. A VARIETY OF CHRISTMAS DECORATIONS AVAILABLE---Besides the luxury style Christmas tree skirt, we also have themed Christmas stockings and other ornaments to go with. Moreover, we also provide rustic, vintage, 3D, DIY, and many other creative styles of decorations, welcome to our store and find the one you were looking for.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A11prSmUjML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Houwsbaby","source_asin":"B07TJMSRVX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-464445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TJMSRVX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TJMSRVX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
