window.products.push({"id":464476,"name":"Fraser Fir Scented Candle | Holiday Notes of Christmas Tree Imbedded with Firs & Pine Cones - Long Burning Candles | Festive Home Fragrance | 6.5oz Gl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AF8JzAH8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Christmas Fir Candle is a beautifully scented candle. The candle has mild citrus top notes, earthy undercurrents, and the beautiful freshness of the woody, fir balsam core. This is an exotic and inviting blend that creates a unique and enticing aroma in your home or office. With the craftsmanship and superior quality you expect from us, our candles are hand-poured and beautifully packaged. Looking for a candle that will help set the Holiday mood? Our Christmas Fir Candle is an aromatic explosion of all things Holiday-related. This candle is scented with a perfect recipe of citrus, earthy and spicy accents. Hands down, this candle smells like Christmas. This Candle has a burn time of 200 hours and measures 3\" in diameter and 3.6\" in height. Add a dash of freshness to your day with this Gute Fir Scented Candle. This candle is perfect for the fall & holiday seasons. The perfect gift for friends, coworkers, & family. Inspired by nature, this collection finds its muse in the colors of fall and winter. Surround your home with the warm, familiar comfort of a traditional autumn day with the Christmas Fir Tree scent from Gute. Fragrant and warm, this fragrance brings to mind the Holiday season with bursts of juicy citrus and an earthy accord of fir pines and nature. Indulge in a calming fir fragrance with a touch of Christmas cheer! The perfect gift for anyone who loves long-lasting candles. Go ahead and reach in. The fragrance isn't going to bite. It's really there! Bet you didn't know fir trees were this dreamy. Fragrant and woody with a splash of spice, our holiday fir candle is wonderfully inviting. Fir, Earthy undertones, and a citrus finish create a delightful scent. Light up your world with one of our Gute Christmas candles!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AF8JzAH8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gute","source_asin":"B0B2KLSBD7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-464476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2KLSBD7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2KLSBD7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
