window.products.push({"id":464594,"name":"Tempur-Pedic 324599 Tp8000 Mesh Task Chair (Tp8000)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qXLdzyTOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reward your hard work with the comfort of this Tempur-Pedic black ergonomic mesh mid-back office chair. Create a more relaxing office environment with this Tempur-Pedic ergonomic mid-back office chair. Breathable mesh construction lets air circulate between you and the seat back, helping to keep you cooler as you work. The TEMPUR memory foam cushion offers added cushion and support for all-day use, while the built-in lumbar support provides relief for sore and strained muscles. With its five-star base and rolling casters, this desk chair moves easily from your workstation to file cabinets or printer stands. Use the adjustable arms to find the perfect height and width for your frame, and move the seat up and down using the pneumatic seat height adjustment lever. This Tempur-Pedic ergonomic mid-back office chair features center tilt, forward tilt and tilt lock, so you can recline comfortably in between projects. Task chair is a smart addition to any office space. Black mesh upholstery allows air to circulate. Mid-back design minimizes stress and strain. Overall dimensions: 36.2-39.8H x 26.8W x 24.4D. Seat dimensions: 19.7W x 20.5D. Back dimensions: 20.5W x 19.9H. Width and height adjustable arms allow you to rest your forearms comfortably Responsive TEMPUR Material and Breathable Mesh BackThe Tempur-Pedic chair TP8000 utilizes TEMPUR material, which intelligently responds to your body's unique features. By perfectly supporting your weight, size, and even temperature, it will help you feel more comfortable in jobs that require extended sitting. Additionally, the chair features a mesh back that allows airflow to keep you cool. Easy Adjustments for Customized ComfortThis mid-back chair is built with a tilt tension lever for easy center tilt changes. When you're satisfied, the tilt lock prevents the chair from leaning past your chosen position.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qXLdzyTOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tempur-Pedic","source_asin":"B07K7LVJG9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-464594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K7LVJG9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K7LVJG9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
