window.products.push({"id":464684,"name":"OWUDE Professional Pumpkin Carving Kit with Double-Side Sculpting Tools 11 Pcs Upgrade Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Carving Tools with Carrying Case and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CTxCyvdVL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Description: Are you prepared to create beautiful pumpkins?  That's why we specially design this Upgrade sturdy and durable stainless steel 11-piece pumpkin carving kit that includes everything you need. Our kit will last you for years! Our Durable stainless steel tools plus our templates are ready to turn you into a pro pumpkin carver.  Our 11-piece Stainless Steel Pumpkin Carving Set is designed with you in mind.  ---The Double-sided Saw is used to cut out the lid of your pumpkin and carve simple designs. ---The Pumpkin Scoop Tool is fantastic for scouring out pumpkin guts cleanly and quickly. ---The Small Saw is used to cut more precise and intricate complex detail patterns. ---The Pumpkin Drill is used for pattern transfer and fine details engraving. ---The Etching Tool is to transfer your design onto the pumpkin.(Used to punch holes or circles.)  ---The 6 double-ended detail carving tools are for shaping details of your design,like creating tooth,nose and hair for the pumpkin to make it more realistic. Safety First Our tools are designed to make carving a pumpkin effortlessly and not break while in use. All this attributes to the safety we help provide. We still caution you to be aware because you are using sharp tools! Kit contains sharp items and is not a toy.Adult supervision are required when children under 9 use this Pumpkin Carving Kit.  Material: Stainless Steel;Rubber  Storage Bag Size: 9.25*7.09*1.85 inch Package Weight: 523g  Color: Black and Orange Package included: 1 x Pumpkin Scoop 1 x Double-sided Saw 1 x Single-sided Saw 1 x Etching Tool  1 x Pumpkin Drill 6 x Double-ended Detail Sculpting, Cutting and Carving Tools 1 x Carrying Zipper Case 6 x Paper Carving Stencils","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CTxCyvdVL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OWUDE","source_asin":"B09XQVZJP9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-464684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XQVZJP9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XQVZJP9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
