window.products.push({"id":464734,"name":"Akivome Manual Airbrush for Cakes, DIY Baking Cake Airbrush Pump Coloring Spray with 4 Pcs Tube, Glitter Decorating Tools for Kitchen Cupcakes Cookies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712+IAR66PS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Perfect Cake Decorating Tool] The manual airbrush gives you full control over the pressure with which your spray is applied, which allows you to quickly and easily apply paint or spray glitter on cakes, cupcakes, chocolates and other desserts. Create funny, glamorous and dazzling cakes [Transparent Canister ] The manual spray is equipped with a pump sprayer and 4pcs reservoirs. Transparent bottle with graduations, you can easily view and measure the color powder you like, work with maximizing precision, bring your cakes back to life! [Kind Reminder] Cake airbrush interlocking system firmly fixes the tube to airbrush pump to ensure that the spray paint will not leak. In order to avoid clogging the pump, you must dry the pump completely before using the glitter powder, and use fine powder instead of coarse powder. Liquid and dry glitter powder need to be separated [Perfect Accessory] Pastry cream chocolate decorating pen with four flower mouth design to meet different needs. Simply fill the pen with chocolate, push the plunger and squeeze to write on a cake, cupcake or pastry. Cake scraper smoother with different tooth and shapes allow you to create edges with different patterns and style on the side or top of the cakes. [Enjoy the Fun of Baking] This manual airbrush is great for beginner cake decorators and seasoned professionals, make it easy for cake colorings and some simple decoration. Suitable for family DIY baking, parent-child activities, couples and family baking or friends gathering baking gatherings. You can enjoy the fun of home baking or create amazing food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712+IAR66PS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Akivome","source_asin":"B092VP6ZN1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-464734","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092VP6ZN1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092VP6ZN1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":464735,"name":"16\" X 6\" Hand Painted Decorative Ceramic Tile Art - Vintage Red Wine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81w3SKvHjjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Tile Art is hand-crafted, painted and kiln fired to insure quality, beauty, and integrity. Our Tile Art will last forever (if not broken) and come with a very glossy, glazed finish. They ship ready to hang or stand (built in stand). The tiles may also easily be used as a traditional building tile. They are the perfect way to brighten up a kitchen back splash or bathroom mosaic, create a beautiful table or tiled floor, or just used for home/business decor! Our products are created through a unique process called tube-lining. It takes a lot of time and patience, an artist draws many details throughout a blank white-fired tile with special tools loaded with a fluid clay. This placed clay acts as a color barrier that contains the over-glazes painted into the sections. Next the tile is hand-painted with rich colorful glazes that set within the clay lines. At this point, the tile is complete and needs to be kiln fired. We put our tiles through an elaborate kiln fire process. They are cooked then cooled throughout several cycles lasting 24 hours. During this kiln firing process, our kilns reach temperatures of over 2000 degrees Fahrenheit. This creates very detailed lines and preserves the colors to last.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81w3SKvHjjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Tile Art","source_asin":"B003V1ZJPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-464735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003V1ZJPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003V1ZJPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
