window.products.push({"id":464779,"name":"HOMICHEF Stock Pot 4 Quart Nickel Free Stainless Steel - 4 Quart Pot With Lid and Handle - 4Qt Saucepan With Lid - Soup Pot Small Cooking Pot 4 Quart ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LlNJ-0DgL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"GO HEALTHY & GREEN WITH HOMICHEF ECOLOGICAL STOCK POTS 1. Unlike most nickel-bearing stainless steel cookware on the market, ours is made of food grade NICKEL FREE stainless steel: non-toxic, non-allergic, and more energy savings.2. Enjoy green and safe cooking with HOMICHEF healthy cookware. QUALITY BUILD BY HOMICHEF 1. These pots are beautifully engineered by HOMICHEF's own in house manufacturing facilities at the world top quality.2. Thick, undeformable 3-ply base (6MM in base thickness) eliminates warping and hotspots effectively, and ensures optimal thermal absorption and transmission.3. Solid riveted handles stay cool on the stovetop. Tight-fitting lid circulates heat & moisture, preserving flavors & nutrients.4. Advanced engineering and nickel free stainless steel provide faster cooking, better nutrition, and more energy savings.5. Compatible with gas, induction, ceramic, glass and halogen stovetops; oven & dishwasher safe. Great for boiling eggs, simmering stocks and soups, or making sauces. NICKEL FREE HARM FREE 1. Nickel-bearing stainless steel is commonly used for cookware, BUT nickel is high up on the ATSDR list of priority toxins (causing allergy and diseases), and nickel LEACHES under regular cooking conditions.2. NICKEL FREE Stainless Steel combines the best of stainless steel (rust-proof) and cast iron (healthy); is not only healthier, but also more heat-conductive than nickel bearing stainless steel. Tests show a noticeable degree (12-15%) of energy savings. ELEGANT APPEARANCE The featured timeless French kitchen elegance cuts a fine figure both in the kitchen and at the dining table.1. Mirror Polished Exterior2. Matte Polished Interior3. Tempered Glass Lid With Steam Vent4. Ergonomical Steel HandlesDiscover the GOURMET CHEF IN YOU with these HEALTHY & BEAUTIFUL & EFFICIENT stockpots.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LlNJ-0DgL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMICHEF","source_asin":"B07SJBKWDT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-464779","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SJBKWDT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SJBKWDT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
