window.products.push({"id":464793,"name":"NIMBLE French Press Stainless Steel Insulated Double-walled Coffee Press, Stone Finish - 34 fl oz. / 1000 ml","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7143cjE7nlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"French press, redefined. The only French press that truly compliments your lifestyle and your home! Nimble French presses not only brew delicious coffee or tea and are practical, but they ALSO look incredible! All Stainless steel construction. Glass French presses often crack and need replacement glass beakers - a headache you don't need to worry about! Nimble French press can survive some serious hits. So whether you're brewing in your home, at work, or atop a mountain, you can do so worry-free. Plus, no plastics or glass is used in making it, so its completely BPA-free & toxin-free! Double-walled construction provides great thermal retention! Don’t you just hate when your coffee gets cold before its even finished? We do too! The Nimble French press lets you enjoy freshly brewed coffee or tea while its hot for hours without it losing its magic. Large capacity of 34 fl.oz - 1000 ml, enough to enjoy 2-4 large cups of your favorite coffee or tea. So if you’re after a caffeine hit for yourself or want to share some freshly brewed goodness with others, the Nimble French press is the perfect solution. All Nimble French presses come with a warranty against manufacturing defects. Should you run into any issues with yours, please don’t hesitate to contact us and we’ll be more then happy to help! Your satisfaction is our utmost priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7143cjE7nlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NIMBLE","source_asin":"B07VQMYJTR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-464793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VQMYJTR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VQMYJTR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
