window.products.push({"id":464820,"name":"SOLIGT Recipe Book to Write in Your Own Recipes, 8.5\" x 11\" Personal Blank Recipe Notebook, Removable Hardcover Recipe Journal Book Binder with 8 Divi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ft1u51bPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PLENTY OF SPACE: Our recipe book set includes: 5 sheets double-sided table of contents that can write 300 fields total, 120 sheets 8.5’’x 11’’ double-sided blank recipe papers, can write 240 recipes total, 8 plastic dividers, 24 labels (12 blank&12 pre-printed) and 1 pocket page. The recipe notebook has enough space for all of those delicious recipes and more. PRESERVE THE BEST RECIPES: With recipe notebook journal by your side, you'll never forget a recipe again! You can store all of them in a recipe notebook spiral bound and make sure that they are safe for future generations! Our recipe journal book pages have an elegant yet simplistic layout that will help you document all your favorite kitchen creations with ease. You can use the pocket inside the back cover of the recipe books to store recipe cards, clippings, and print-outs etc. ORGANIZE THE WAY YOU WANT IT: We've designed our recipe book to be as user-friendly and convenient for you. You can customize the recipe journal notebook to suit your needs by taking out from the binder ring and reorganizing pages so that they're in a more convenient order. This recipe journal book has 8 dividers and 24 tabs, which means it's easy to separate your recipes into categories or categorize them based on the occasion they're meant for. DURABLE & DIRT-RESISTANT: The great thing about our recipe book is that they can withstand most kitchen messes. The cover of the recipe notebook are made from durable plastic that is resistant to dirt. You can just wipe off the worst spills without worrying about damaging your precious recipes. In this binder ring blank recipe notebook, we use 100gms pages. The pages won't tear or curl away from your handwriting as time goes by so they'll be around for many years! PERFECT GIFT: This recipe book journal is beautifully designed with pictures of vegetables and kitchenware on its inside cover. Our recipe book would be such a great present for anyone who loves cooking because they'll always have their favorite recipes at hand without having to search through piles of loose-leaf paper or folders. A recipe notebook is an excellent option for a birthday, mother’s day, wedding, bridal shower, or any other occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ft1u51bPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOLIGT","source_asin":"B092QB5Z6Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-464820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092QB5Z6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092QB5Z6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
