window.products.push({"id":464962,"name":"EOTIA Meat Tenderizer Different Sizes of Fangs Offer Delicious Taste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t50WU4TPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why EOTIA: In Ancient Greek religion, Hestia (Greek: Ἑστία) is virgin goddess of hearth architecture and the right ordering of domesticity, the family, the home, and the state; the protector of chefs and mill workers and has close ties with thousands of families. The flame symbolizes her presence and the promise of warmth to every family member at every meal time. Our company（Eotia）specializes in kitchen tools — tools that work in a close relationship with fire, temperature, family. Eotia upholds the mission and responsibilities of the goddess Hestia to make cooking a prosperous and communal journey for each family — so that every food carries love, health, and happiness.  Our kitchen utensils whisper secrets that make every mealtime intentional, filled with warmth and tasty goodness. Unlike the original barbaric era when humans ate their meat fairly cooked or totally uncooked, using only simple tools to eat and cook food, now, we pay attention to the amount of heat used during food preparation, employing professional kitchen utensils, thus, making more delicious meals. This is what we want for you and your family. Company Intro: Eotia is an international kitchen utensil manufacturing and sales company committed to providing our customers with a faster, reliable and more comfortable kitchen utensil shopping experience, accompanied with the happiness that every meal should bring to a family. Founded in 2005 as a small local office factory, Eotia has grown to be a major utensil distributor in Asia, South America and almost all of Europe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t50WU4TPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EOTIA","source_asin":"B07VG675G1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-464962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VG675G1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VG675G1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
